Cell["\<\
8*((m1*ma - \
Pair(Momentum(s,p1,W,theta,thetaStar,phiStar),Momentum(s,q1,W,theta,thetaStar,\
phiStar)))*
      Pair(Momentum(s,q,W,theta,thetaStar,phiStar),Momentum(s,q,W,theta,\
